    "lawCode": "Amd §1210, Tax L",
    "lawSection": "Tax Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S4247\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\nAn act to amend the tax law, in relation to the imposition of sales\nand compensating use taxes in the city of Oswego\n\n\n PURPOSE :\nTo extend the authorization granted to the city of Oswego to impose an\nadditional one percent of sales and compensating use taxes.\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\nExtends to November 30, 2011 the authorization for the city of Oswego\nto impose an additional one percent sales and compensating tax will\nnow sunset on November 30, 2009. The revenues anticipated from the\nextension of the additional tax will allow the city of Oswego to\ncontinue to provide services that it deems vital, while maintaining a\nbalanced budget.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\nNew bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\nNone to the state.\n\n LOCAL FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\nContinued enhanced revenue for the city of Oswego.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nImmediately.\n",
